# Who may publish and subscribe to what. Topic shape: docs/MQTT_CONTRACT.md
#   agriedge/farm/{farm}/zone/{zone}/{soil|weather|status|irrigation/...}
#
# Anything not granted here is denied.

# Field sensor and pump nodes: report readings, receive irrigation commands.
user sensor
topic write agriedge/farm/+/zone/+/soil
topic write agriedge/farm/+/zone/+/weather
topic write agriedge/farm/+/zone/+/status
topic write agriedge/farm/+/zone/+/irrigation/status
topic read  agriedge/farm/+/zone/+/irrigation/set

# The agri-edge backend: reads everything on the farm bus. It does not command
# valves -- irrigation decisions are recommendations a human or Node-RED rule
# turns into a command.
user agriedge
topic read agriedge/#

# Node-RED owns the irrigation rules, so it is the one client allowed to
# publish irrigation/set.
user nodered
topic readwrite agriedge/#
